        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "1. 有限数列可按它的项的序号递增的顺序列出它的项的方法给出."
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[1]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0081#6"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "例如，这样给出数列$(a_n)$：",
          "$1,4,9,16,25,36,49,64,81,100$. $(1)$"
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[2]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0081#7"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "这种情况实际上就是利用给出函数的列表法.",
          "其实，上面的$(1)$行就是下表的简略写法："
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[4]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0081#9"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "2. 数列可以用说明的方法给出"
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[5]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0081#10"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "举例说，设已知数列$(c_n)$的项是按递增的顺序取的小于20的质数.",
          "通过这个说明，很容易求出$c_1=2$，$c_2=3$，$c_3=5$，$c_4=7$，$c_5=11$，$c_6=13$，$c_7=17$，$c_8=19$."
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[6]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0082#1"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "数列$(c_n)$是有限数列，它的项数等于8."
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[7]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0082#2"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "通过说明的方法也可以给出无穷数列.",
          "举例说，设有一个数列$(d_n)$，它的每一项都用数字2写出，而数字2的个数等于数列的项的序号."
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[8]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0082#3"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "这个说明使我们能够求出这个数列的任何一项，就是：",
          "$d_1=2,d_2=22,d_3=222,\\cdots,\\underbrace{d_n=22\\cdots2}_{n\\text{个}}$，",
          "$\\cdots$."
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[9]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0082#4"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "3. 数列可以用能求出它的任何一项的公式给出."
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[10]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0082#5"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 2,
        "lines": [
          "例如，假设数列$(b_n)$是这样一个数列，对于每一个序号$n$，对应的项$b_n$可以按照下面的公式求出：",
          "$b_n=n^2-n+1$.",
          "",
          "依次地用自然数$1,2,3,4,\\cdots$代替公式中的$n$，得到：",
          "$b_1=1^2-1+1=1$，",
          "$b_2=2^2-2+1=3$，",
          "$b_3=3^2-3+1=7$，",
          "$b_4=4^2-4+1=13$，等等."
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[11]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0082#6"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "利用项的序号$n$表示数列每一项的公式，叫做数列的通项公式."
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[12]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0082#7"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "我们再举一些利用通项公式给出数列的例子."
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[13]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0082#8"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "公式$a_n=\\sqrt{n}$给出一无穷数列，它的每一个项都是自然数的算术平方根：",
          "$\\sqrt{1},\\sqrt{2},\\sqrt{3},\\sqrt{4},\\cdots$."
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      },
      {
        "target": "lesson.prose[14]",
        "source_refs": [
          "p0082#9"
        ],
        "paragraph_count": 1,
        "lines": [
          "公式$c_n=(-1)^n10$给出一无穷数列，它所有的奇数项都等于$-10$，而所有的偶数项都等于10：",
          "$-10,10,-10,10,\\cdots$."
        ],
        "idempotent": true,
        "second_application_unchanged": true
      }
    ],
